      { q: "Are large deck replacements on Oakton custom homes more complex than typical projects?", a: "Yes. Oakton's custom homes from the 1975 to 1995 era often have substantial original deck configurations — 500 to 800 square feet, multi-level, with integrated stairs and sometimes structural shade elements. Replacement projects on these homes require detailed structural assessment, careful integration with mature landscape features, and more complex permitting (larger footprints and multi-level structures require more detailed structural drawings). LDN Decks has experience with large-footprint custom deck replacements throughout Oakton." }
