      { q: "Does LDN Decks work in Prince William County?", a: "Yes. LDN Decks builds decks across Northern Virginia including Prince William County communities like Haymarket, Gainesville, Manassas, and Bristow. We handle the Prince William County permit process and HOA submissions for all governed communities. Our service area includes Dominion Valley Country Club and the Route 15 and Route 66 corridors in western Prince William County." }
